/-!
Slim helper: Nodup of the 2602 block-0 gate lows (piv and bp-1 of each of 1301 gates).
Standalone; no QHNet / QHNetRec / Pnd / Mathlib. No mergeSort decide and no ∈-decide
on the 2602-element lists (those proof terms OOM). Uses 100-row `rfl` index certificates,
chunked isStrictSorted, and pigeonhole: sorted ⊆ flat, equal length, sorted.Nodup.
-/

